### =========================================================================
### GO CRUD API - HTTP REQUEST COLLECTION (REST CLIENT)
### Gunakan extension "REST Client" di VS Code untuk klik "Send Request"
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# Simpan token JWT hasil login di variabel ini untuk request yang terproteksi:
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTENTIKASI (PUBLIK & PRIVAT)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Register User Baru (Publik)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.2 Login User (Publik) - Salin token dari response ke variabel @authToken di atas
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 1.3 Cek Profil User Saya (Terproteksi JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PRODUK (READ ONLY - PUBLIK)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Ambil Semua Produk (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 2.2 Ambil Satu Produk Berdasarkan ID (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. PRODUK (WRITE OPERATIONS - TERPROTEKSI JWT)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Tambah Produk Baru (Wajib Token JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Headphone Bluetooth Wireless",
  "price": 850000,
  "stock": 15,
  "category_id": 1
}

### 3.2 Update Data Produk (Wajib Token JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Keyboard Mekanikal Pro RGB",
  "price": 520000,
  "stock": 20,
  "category_id": 2
}

### 3.3 Hapus Produk (Soft Delete - Wajib Token JWT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
